# Sensitive paths: changes here need a human review (merge policy C lets the
# agent merge its own PRs only when required checks are green).
# Replace the placeholder owner on each rule below with a GitHub user or
# team (e.g. @acme/maintainers).
# GitHub ignores lines whose owner does not exist, so an unreplaced
# placeholder protects nothing. `kb init` creates this file once and never
# rewrites it.

/.github/CODEOWNERS @OWNER
/.github/workflows/ @OWNER
/.claude/settings.json @OWNER
/.claude/agents/ @OWNER
/.claude/skills/ @OWNER
/.claude/commands/ @OWNER
/docs/review-rubric.md @OWNER
/docs/review-rubric.local.md @OWNER
